# NervAOSP

NervAOSP is a custom Android 16 ROM based on LineageOS. Use a
LineageOS-compatible device tree.

## Build

```bash
repo init -u https://github.com/NervAOSP/Manifest.git -b 16.2 --git-lfs --depth 1
repo sync -c --force-sync --no-clone-bundle --no-tags -j$(nproc)
. b*/env*
```

Select a device, then build (this also packages the flashable zip):

```bash
unit <codename>-userdebug     # e.g. unit courbet-userdebug
fly -j$(nproc --all)
```

Output: `NervAOSP-Eva-01-<date>-<variant>-<device>.zip`

## GMS

Set `NERV_VAR` in `lineage_<codename>.mk` to select build-time integrated GMS:

```make
NERV_VAR := full      # GMS
# NERV_VAR := pico    # minimal
# NERV_VAR := core    # core
# NERV_VAR := vanilla # non-GMS (default)
```

Variants map to the `GMS`/`PICO`/`CORE` suffix of the zip name.
